and 4 general stores in the process.

I used darts a lot until D2 where I bought a +1 elven spear and
enchanted it to +3.  Started using that, but tourists only get to basic
in spear.

Found an aligned altar on D2 also, but could sac enough for an
artifact.  I went into the mines hoping to kill a dwarf with lots of
armor and the first dwarf I killed had shoes, helm, milthril coat, and
shield.  Some of it +1!  The shoes were cursed and I didn't notice so I
had to use my only ?oRM to uncurse them.  Didn't notice because they
were +0.

Tried to get to Sobokan first, but it was way way down there so I
headed for mine town.  In Mine town there were DWARVES EVERYWHERE.  I
hate those guys.  They pick axed the whole level, including my aligned
temple.  I took the Lady's revenge on those annoying pests.

Here, the Lady gave me Molljinr (YAY) and Ogresmasher (Ugh).  And some
